title: 'Rust RFC process: an RFC is needed for a change in meaning or a removal, not for bug fixes, refactors or documentation.'
pid: cfb35c29-e0b0-4336-9129-41b961ba0f12
body: |2-
  https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/blob/master/README.md
  A final comment period of ten days, after every subteam member
  signs off. An accepted RFC is not changed much afterward: minor
  amendments only, and a larger change is a new RFC with a note on
  the old one.
